WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.002
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.136
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.939
And now we are going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.975
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.310
scheduled a last-minute
public hearing for today

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.647
with former Trump White House
aide Cassidy Hutchinson,

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:15.815
and it was wild.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.650
We learned that on January 6th,

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.552
Trump knew the crowd
had weapons,

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:21.754
that he tried to get
the metal detectors removed

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.523
because, quote,
"They're not here to hurt me."

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.392
He got mad at Bill Barr
over lunch

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:30.529
and threw a plate
full of ketchup at the wall.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.099
And that when he found out
that his limo

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.501
was not going to the Capitol,

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.336
he lunged for the throat
of a Secret Service agent

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:40.240
and tried to grab
the steering wheel.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.741
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.475
I mean, isn't that unreal?

00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:46.312
Who has ketchup at lunch?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.881
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.517
President Biden on Saturday

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.953
signed the bipartisan
gun safety bill into law.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.588
This news first reported
by a tiny crawl

00:00:56.588 --> 00:00:58.892 line:0%
on the bottom
of your screen.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.560 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.528
That's right, President Biden
signed the law --

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.731
signed into law the first major
federal gun safety legislation

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.268
in nearly three decades --
three decades!

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:11.270
In the time it took you guys
to pass one gun law,

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.773
there's been six Batmen.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.775
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.978
After the Supreme Court
overturned Roe vs. Wade,

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:21.514
former Vice President Mike Pence
praised the decision

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:24.684
and said in a statement,
quote, "Today, life won."

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:28.187 line:0%
"Whereas on January 6th,
it was touch-and-go."

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:30.323 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.026
After the Supreme Court
overturned Roe vs. Wade

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.027
last week,
Dick's Sporting Goods

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:38.230
announced that it will provide
financial support for employees

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:41.067
who need to travel out of state
for abortion access.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.468
Ahh, Dick's --

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.970
the problem AND the solution.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.173
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.945
The rare case.

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.580
The Supreme Court ruled
yesterday

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.183
that the First Amendment
protects public school employees

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.284
who pray openly.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.318
Alright.

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:00.953
Well, you know
what you got to do,

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:02.922
art teachers.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.257
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:07.427
Counting on you, art teachers.

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:09.829
In an interview after
he was slapped on the back

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.964
by an employee of
a Staten Island grocery store,

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:14.333
Rudy Giuliani said
that it felt like, quote,

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:15.734
"Somebody shot me."

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.103
Wow. That is...

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.305
That is awful.
Let's see the tape.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.142
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:27.814
Do you think that's what
being shot feels like?!

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:31.050
No wonder you're not
concerned about guns.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.887
That wasn't a slap -- that was
a Little League coach saying,

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:35.922
"You'll get 'em next time."

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:36.923
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.424
According to New York's MTA,

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.959
in the first five months
of this year,

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.895
over 400 incidents
were reported of people

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:46.165
riding on top of
or outside subway trains.

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:47.600
In their defense, though.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.136
have you seen
the inside of those trains?

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.738
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.706
A Norwegian Cruise Line ship

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.174
struck an iceberg
over the weekend

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:56.876
while sailing
off the coast of Alaska.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.210
Finally, some good news --

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.213
there are still icebergs!

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:01.681
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:05.484
And finally, a Chihuahua mix
named Mr. Happy Face

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:08.388
was recently crowned
the world's ugliest dog.

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:11.223
They knew it was a winner
when the other dogs

00:03:11.223 --> 00:03:13.226
started sniffing its face.

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:14.894
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.229
Scollins!

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:17.897
That was a monologue, everybody.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.232
We got a great show
for you tonight.

